WEBVTT

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.480
Winner of the first match is...

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.990
Naruse Mio!

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.780
I won't lose either.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:06.020
No one knows where he is from,

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:09.600
but everyone knows how strong he is!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.720
The Masked Noble,

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.520
Lars,

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.530
finally takes the stage!

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.200
Why are you betraying us?

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.640
Come now,

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:30.920
what point is there in asking that now?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.500
If I told you I had my own reasons,

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.710
would you go easy on me?

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:38.840
Second Match!

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.070
Lars versus Maria!

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.850
Go! Fight!

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.100
Could you be any more predictable?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.120
I didn't think you'd use Valga's technique.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.370
But...

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.130
Did you think you'd be safe

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.630
by only using close quarters combat?

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.630
As expected of our Masked Noble!

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.640
He's on a different level from that succubus!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.640
Maria!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:28.040
An explosion can be blocked by a magic barrier

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.640
as long as there's even a faint gap.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:38.650
Even though Maria's stronger than she was back then...

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.030
You're wide open.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:32.210
He nailed it!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.980
Take that, bitch!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.690
Prepare yourself!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:57.970
<i>Lars...</i>

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.360
<i>Why?</i>

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.360
<i>Why?</i>

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:07.900
Don't cry!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.750
We're going to become stronger!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.620
We need to be strong,

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:17.040
so that we won't lose to anyone!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:20.630
So,

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.810
don't cry over this!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.220
Lars...

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:34.890
<i>Why?!</i>

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:38.820
How many times have you fought in that form?

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.900
Only a few at most, right?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.650
Even worse, it's the first time you've transformed in the demon realm.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.770
You're at the mercy of your own great power.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.910
Avoiding attacks like that...

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:58.160
is hardly difficult.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:04.120
You're asking for too much if you think using power you're not used to

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.920
will win the match.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.930
I'm sure you wanted to win no matter what, but...

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.680
too bad for you.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:23.940
Kill her!

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:28.950
Kill her! Kill her! Kill...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.410
Kill her!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.200
Kill her! Kill her!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.950
Shut up!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.210
Listen closely!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.940
Whom I kill and when is my choice!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.080
Be quiet!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.610
Uhh...

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.510
I-It's settled!

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.790
Winner of the second match: Lars!

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.520
Now the score is tied one-to-one!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.630
Yay!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.630
Pardon me.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.490
<i>Lars is still Lars!</i>

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.030
I'm sorry!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.270
I'm going to go check on Maria!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.000
<i>Maria...</i>

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.010
<i>Basara...</i>

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.050
Zest.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.900
We're out of drinks.

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:39.490
Sorry, but could you bring us some more?

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.020
Huh?

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:42.490
Please.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.180
I understand.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.960
You're up next, Kurumi.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.120
You need to hurry.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.200
Yeah,

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:00.050
I'm going.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.210
I'm going, but...

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:05.860
Onee,

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:06.740
listen.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.640
Mio's not the only one

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.170
who gets to decide what she wants.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:14.710
Huh?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.880
You can go where you want

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.720
and do what you want, as well.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.310
Everyone, including me,

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.440
will support you all the way.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:31.290
At the very least, say everything you want to say to me.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.360
Kurumi,

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.050
I...

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.910
Kurumi,

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:48.960
thank you.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.600
Third Stage!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:06.600
Admirath versus Nonaka Kurumi!

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.730
The loyal retainer of council member Lord Madonis,

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.160
Viscount Admirath, takes the stage!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.950
His fighting style is splendid and magnificent!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:20.620
He's sure to drown this member of the hero clan in a pool of blood!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.120
My name is Admirath.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.620
It's a pleasure meeting you.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.160
I'm sure you must be concerned

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.890
since Jin Toujou's son has yet to return,

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.740
but please fight well.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.110
I think you can understand what I'm requesting of you.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.960
I'm not going to fall for such petty tricks!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.150
Are you stupid?

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.420
The choice is yours.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:00.660
Just don't forget that his fate rests on your shoulders.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.420
<i>It's a lie.</i>

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.850
<i>It has to be!</i>

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:05.660
<i>But...</i>

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.770
<i>But what if...</i>

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.760
<i>If I cause Basara to...</i>

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.230
Third Match!

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:14.670
Admirath versus Nonaka Kurumi!

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:17.420
Go! Fight!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:26.230
Are you sure she's going to be all right?

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.580
Yes. Don't worry.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.560
I see.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:45.950
How is Luka doing?

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:48.860
He's in a state of shock,

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.710
but he's resting in the medical room for now.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.150
I see.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.720
Setting that aside,

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.010
we have immediate matters here.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.710
Yes.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.620
<i>Kurumi?</i>

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:13.560
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:17.070
<i>This isn't how she fights.</i>

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.070
<i>Kurumi!</i>

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.530
Something's off.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.920
Yes.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.730
They look like they're fighting fiercely,

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.550
but their attacks are too simple.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.310
First of all, that young woman would never

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:32.540
challenge Admirath to a contest of speed.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.040
Most likely,

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.870
Admirath did something to her before the match.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.600
What shall we do?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.050
We have no obligation to help her, right?

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.060
This is war, after all.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.120
However,

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.940
I'm concerned about what the council is plotting.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:54.680
In that case,

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.510
I'll go investigate them.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:02.650
I have a bit of time before my match, after all.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:03.310
Please do.

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:13.690
Very good.

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:17.090
It's fun living up to the crowd's expectations.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.770
Go, my trusted steed!

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.610
<i>Basara-niichan!</i>

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.860
Kurumi!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.870
You danced wonderfully for me.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.390
I appreciate it,

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.080
young heroine.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:58.530
Farewell.

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:10.290
What do you think you're doing?

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.730
The match has already been determined.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.150
Do you have any right to decide that?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.360
Why, you!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.150
Fine, then!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:24.480
I'll accept Nonaka Kurumi's defeat.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.710
However, even if it was an attempt to save your comrade's life,

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:32.050
you've interfered with a match before it was decided!

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.160
That sin demands a high price!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.040
Therefore, the fourth match

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.030
will be a defeat by disqualification for Zest!

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.540
Winner of the third match,

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.420
Admirath!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:51.180
And the fourth match is a victory for us by default!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.450
What vulgar tricks.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:56.180
Their fate is now but a candle in the breeze!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:56.180
If we lose the next match, it's over for us, isn't it?

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.890
Yahoo!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:59.190
Basara...

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:08.950
Hmph.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.940
Again?

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:12.950
How boring.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.840
Twerp.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.030
Oh?

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.560
That scent is Zolgia's...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.080
I see.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.730
So you prepared that to hide yourself from me.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:43.230
As to be expected of that man's son.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.300
Hmm.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:49.240
Now that I've seen them closely,
 your companions are my type, as well.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.880
I'm going to enjoy

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:56.280
that girl Naruse Mio quite a bit.

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.650
I'll use her a thousand, or tens of thousands of times,

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:01.250
until both her body and mind give out.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.050
You bastard!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.870
You got cut on purpose?!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.070
I'll never...

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:16.260
Belphegor will never...

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.350
Die.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.740
I'm sorry for acting on my own.

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:32.280
Kurumi...

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:35.850
Ah.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.040
That's...

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.650
So that was why.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.040
How dare they!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.670
Take care of my little sister.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.240
That was splendid, Admirath!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.970
Indeed! Not only did you win,

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:59.290
you made their next opponent lose by disqualification!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.720
I thought

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:04.560
I might provide some quality entertainment instead of just seizing victory.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.480
Scoring two victories for the council

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.570
means a great deal.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:12.510
If I may be greedy,

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:15.320
I wish I could've killed that hero with my own hands.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.980
Still, for things to go this well for us...

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.660
If this keeps up, we won't even need to use <i>that</i>.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.150
You said it.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.730
What's the matter, Admirath?

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:28.310
No,

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.960
it seems it was just my imagination.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.840
"Won't even need to use <i>that</i>,"

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.250
I wonder...

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:42.250
I should investigate to be sure.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.480
It's time for our next warrior to arrive!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.490
Personal guard to the Head of Council, Lord Benares.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.580
Unmatched in brute strength, the King of Destruction,

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.570
Volga!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.540
Crush her! Break her!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.990
Stomp her into the ground!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.850
Volga!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.250
Volga!

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:04.750
Fifth stage!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.750
Volga!

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:07.120
Volga versus

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.170
Volga!

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:09.790
Nonaka Yuki!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.750
Volga!

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.820
Oh, was it you?

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:15.510
Are you the hero who killed my older brother, Valga?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.750
Oh, don't misunderstand.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.480
He was a failure who was all talk.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.670
It was a given he'd be killed.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:26.520
Just don't think I'm going to
 be the same as that washout.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.000
You're a cold woman.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:31.800
Is it that?

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:36.030
Are you too embarrassed after your little sister lost so pathetically?

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:39.760
Heh,

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.930
so you can make a face like that too, huh?

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.630
Listen, cowardly sister of that shitty piece-of-trash woman,

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.440
it'll be only one blow!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.040
In one blow, I'll turn you into mincemeat!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:52.770
Fifth match!

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.970
Go! Fight!

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:03.060
Take this!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:12.570
Hmm?

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.500
W-Winner of the fifth match,

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.680
Nonaka Yuki!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.090
Hey now,

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.310
he got done in more smoothly

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.500
than his washout brother.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.800
We did it!

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.600
Thank goodness!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:48.600
If Rukia-sama loses the next match...

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.700
No, even if she wins it...

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.810
Don't worry.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.400
Basara will return.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.580
No matter what happens,

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.280
please believe in me.

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.510
I'm sure he'll be back.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.320
<i>Th-This is...!</i>

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.180
So,

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:18.800
what do we now, Leohart?

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:21.420
It's definitely getting too late.

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:24.540
You can't even reach him with your contact magic?

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.820
No.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:29.790
I can't sense Balflear's spiritual presence anywhere.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:32.830
First, Toujou Basara disappears,

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.650
and now it's Balflear, huh?

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:36.820
You don't think...

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.370
We are talking about Balflear here.{I know Balflear.}

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:43.110
He won't fall into the council's hands that easily.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:46.580
I'm sure he has his own reasons for his actions.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.050
But you know, at this rate,

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:51.570
the council will take advantage of us again.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:55.330
I can't believe it!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.840
The vice-general Balflear has forfeited the sixth match!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:03.090
It's their victory by default!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.680
Is that even possible?!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.470
We'll kill you!

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:09.140
However, worry not!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.350
Because...

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:15.960
we have His Majesty Leohart with us!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.670
Leohart! Leohart!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.670
Leohart is...

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.620
But Basara-sama still hasn't...

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:28.870
It looks like Basara-sama hasn't returned.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.870
Then we'll have Ramsus-sama

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:35.360
take part in the final battle.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.520
Any problems?

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.210
Wait!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.460
I know Basara will—

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.010
Look at this!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.780
The ultimate stage,

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:55.340
perfect for the final battle to determine the fate of the demon realm!

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.600
The most forbidden land in all the demon realm!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.580
The eternal battlefield, blessed by our demon gods!

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.440
The Demon Lord's battlefield:

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.700
Xamdu!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:08.820
What's this?

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:12.910
They're using magic power to transform the space into another location.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.940
They brought out Xamdu.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.920
It looks like we'll have no choice but for Ramsus-sama take the field.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.420
What do you mean?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.650
That place is...

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.360
a special battlefield created

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:28.940
for those of the Demon Lord's bloodline to risk their lives and honor in battle.

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:33.180
Only those with the Demon Lord's blood are able to set foot in it.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.010
You mean...

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:35.820
Then,

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.410
even if Basara-sama returns,

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:40.450
he can't fight on that stage?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.840
No way.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.000
Basara!
